From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:58:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Refresh the setup page after an action and use Home's step
 names.

A setup action drops the cached status, including a read that was already in flight, and the page keeps refreshing until the status changes. Step titles come from Rubi Home: Claude sign-in, T3 installed, pinned and running, and T3 paired with Rubi Home.
